{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_016_1000_036kan", "source_sha256": "e3aeadb5a9ba196827f0c93f1f60bd40a05f2c1df0b128f846c10a5589bc4c25", "ja": "らんらら～♪\n……あれ？\n杏奈ちゃん、何してるの？", "zh": "啦啦啦～♪\n……咦？\n杏奈，你在做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_016_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "8779b99a9571978fcf8dcc6cd9f9deec313361eb9ba32680467ee807e855d426", "ja": "ゲーム……音ゲー……。\n新しい曲……\n配信された、から……。", "zh": "玩游戏……音乐游戏……\n因为……\n出了新歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
