{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_016_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "6df64cd8b090cb47d85b338858b899b4232098ef4f7c7088e615744e2833efe8", "ja": "{$P$}さんに、\nあとでお願いしてみよ～っと♪", "zh": "等等去拜托一下\n{$P$}先生好了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_016_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "d29f072003d9087c8322455e2d616cba204469cf86558c88409e9210ad78c749", "ja": "今日のレッスンでも\n音程を外してたのに、\nよくそんなことが言えるわね。", "zh": "你在今天的练习中\n明明也走音了，\n居然还有脸说这种话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_016_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "6c9b1de12cd7aced3a8d84fb82e54f36db23023387a230e32d701d21ec2636cd", "ja": "はうっ！？\n志保ちゃん、厳しい～…。", "zh": "啊呜！？\n志保好严格～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
